<!-- SHIP -->
<section class="case-section">
  <h2>The ship.</h2>
  <div class="copy">
    <p>Luqman shipped as part of Dalael Centre's Arabic‑language offering — built right‑to‑left from the first wireframe, not retrofitted afterward. Two public camps ran at launch, with the private‑camp model letting schools and community groups run their own cohorts on the same system.</p>
    <p>A separate guardian account type sits alongside the Explorer account, so a parent can watch a child's progress without ever taking over their map — the passport, badges and certificates stay the child's own.</p>
  </div>
</section>

